OL,3,AFlorida Republicans fend off Democrats
OL,4,Aas state elects first black governor
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepublican candidates in Florida have
OL,7,Fheld off several high-profile
OL,8,Fchallenges from Democrats, as results
OL,9,Falso saw the state elect its first
OL,10,Fblack governor.
OL,12,FRepublican Byron Donalds, backed by
OL,13,FPresident Donald Trump, was projected
OL,14,Fto win as governor, while Republican
OL,15,FAshley Moody was projected to have held
OL,16,Fher seat in the senate.
OL,18,FShe was up against Democrat Angie Nixon
OL,19,Fin the special election for Secretary
OL,20,Fof State Marco Rubio's old Senate seat.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
